+// Gears2-Native SDK patch 32: an optional observer told about every file the title opens successfully (not
+// directories), on the opening thread, after the open: the guest path (Entry::absolute_path) and, for a file on a host
+// folder device, its host path (else null). For work that follows a file open (a port warming the shaders of a level
+// package the moment the game opens it). One observer; null = none (the default: nothing changes). Keep it cheap:
+// copy what you need and return. REX_FILESYSTEM_FILE_OPEN_OBSERVER tells code built against this SDK that it exists.
+#define REX_FILESYSTEM_FILE_OPEN_OBSERVER 1
+using FileOpenObserver = void (*)(std::string_view guest_path, const std::filesystem::path* host_path);
+void SetFileOpenObserver(FileOpenObserver observer);
